      MIM''s pipeline; confidence=LOW; rationale=5 candidates; top OLS candidates:
      CHEBI:208735(Atrop-Abybetaomicin C), CHEBI:70593(Abyssomicin I), CHEBI:226794(Atrop-Ilyoresorcy
      A). Pending curator promotion to a CHEBI/NCIT primary identifier.'
  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH
    source: MESH via EBI OLS exact synonym search
    notes: Promoted from kgmicrobe.compound:atrop_abyssomicin_c after OLS returned
